# oc-sim scenario v1
# RATCHET against TR1's rate (journal/D-032): launched as in ratchet.scn,
# then three triggers 200 ticks apart: 248 ms on the simulator's clock, which
# charges each tick its two clock reads, so the title shows 242 BPM. The
# default burst has four even repeats, 100 ms apart: on the timeline the last
# two, at 300 and 400 ms, fall past the dotted line where the next trigger is
# due, and are drawn short: the restart would cut them.
ticks 700
20  button up down
60  button down down
70  button up up
70  button down up
90  button down down
100 button down up
110 button down down
120 button down up
130 button down down
140 button down up
160 button right down
166 button right up
200 trigger 1 high
202 trigger 1 low
400 trigger 1 high
402 trigger 1 low
600 trigger 1 high
602 trigger 1 low
